  "title": "钻速预测与参数优化",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "updated": "2026-10-24",

  "tabs": {
    "background": {
      "label": "专业背景",
      "lede": "机械钻速（ROP）是钻头在井底破碎岩石的速度，现场按 m/h 计。它由两类变量决定：司钻能调的钻压、转速、排量，和司钻改不了的地层可钻性、岩性、围压。钻速优化的本质，是在一个有硬边界的参数空间里找局部最优——而不是找一个更大的模型。",
      "judge": [
        { "label": "任务类型", "value": "时序回归 + 约束优化", "desc": "逐米预测 ROP，再在安全边界内搜参数" },
        { "label": "数据门槛", "value": "3—5 口井", "desc": "高频参数 1—10 s，按井分组" },
        { "label": "可见收益", "value": "ROP +15%—30%", "desc": "同等进尺少用钻时（示例值）" },
        { "label": "难度", "value": "高", "html": "<span class='dtag' data-d='高'>难度 高</span>", "desc": "闭环涉及井下安全，外推风险高" }
      ],
      "sections": [
        {
          "no": 1,
          "en": "PROBLEM",
          "title": "当前做法与问题",
          "html": "<p>钻压从低往高加，钻速先近似线性上升；到某个点后井底岩屑来不及被泥浆冲走，钻头出现"重复破碎"，钻速反而往下走——这个拐点叫 <b>founder point</b>。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='钻压与机械钻速的三段关系'><rect width='620' height='200' fill='#ffffff'/><rect x='64' y='30' width='106' height='128' fill='#f9e9e5' fill-opacity='.65'/><rect x='210' y='30' width='110' height='128' fill='#e6f1ec' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='330' y='30' width='90' height='128' fill='#f9efd7' fill-opacity='.6'/><line x1='64' y1='158' x2='420' y2='158' stroke='#c9c2b0'/><line x1='64' y1='158' x2='64' y2='30' stroke='#c9c2b0'/><path d='M64 158 L268 56 C300 50 340 96 420 114' fill='none' stroke='#4d565b' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linecap='round'/><line x1='270' y1='30' x2='270' y2='158' stroke='#b26a39' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='3 3' stroke-opacity='.8'/><circle cx='270' cy='56' r='3.4' fill='#b26a39'/><text x='64' y='18' font-size='8.4' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>机械钻速 ROP ↑</text><text x='170' y='150' font-size='8.4' font-weight='600' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='middle'>现场常用</text><text x='265' y='150' font-size='8.4' font-weight='600' fill='#235f51' text-anchor='middle'>甜点区</text><text x='375' y='150' font-size='8.4' font-weight='600' fill='#a97a1c' text-anchor='middle'>过压区</text><text x='276' y='172' font-size='8' fill='#b26a39' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>founder</text><text x='420' y='172' font-size='8.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='end' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>钻压 WOB →</text><text x='64' y='192' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a'>线性段：加一档钻压，钻速近似线性上升</text><text x='330' y='192' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a'>拐点后：岩屑清不出去，钻头重复破碎</text></svg><p>现场为了避开卡钻、憋跳和钻具损伤，长期停在线性段左侧，把 20%—30% 的钻速留在了桌上。<b>这不是保守，是因为没人敢在看不见井底的情况下试</b>。</p><p>更麻烦的是钻速没有绝对值：同一套参数在泥岩和砂岩里能差一倍，邻井经验换一口井就失效。</p><p><b>图注</b>　三段曲线的形状是物理决定的；但拐点落在哪个钻压，取决于地层与钻头，必须逐井估计。</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 2,
          "en": "INTERVENTION",
          "title": "AI 能做什么",
          "html": "<p>把钻速看成"参数 × 地层"的函数：先用高频数据学一个逐米的 ROP 预测器，再在一个带约束的优化器里搜下一段的参数。<b>算法只输出建议，不直接下指令</b>——这是钻井场景能落地的前提。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 122' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='钻速优化的五个环节'><rect width='620' height='122' fill='#ffffff'/><rect x='8' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='8' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#9ba3a9'/><text x='18' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>01 · INPUT</text><text x='18' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>高频参数</text><text x='18' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>钻压 / 转速</text><text x='18' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>扭矩 / 立压</text><path d='M121 55 h8' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M129 55 l-3.6 -3.4 v6.8 z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='131' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#41699b' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='131' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#41699b'/><text x='141' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#41699b' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>02 · FEATURE</text><text x='141' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>逐米特征</text><text x='141' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>机械比能 MSE</text><text x='141' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>d-exponent</text><path d='M244 55 h8' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M252 55 l-3.6 -3.4 v6.8 z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='254' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='254' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#2f7d6b'/><text x='264' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#2f7d6b' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>03 · MODEL</text><text x='264' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>ROP 预测</text><text x='264' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>给 μ 和 σ</text><text x='264' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>按井分组</text><path d='M367 55 h8' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M375 55 l-3.6 -3.4 v6.8 z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='377' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#b26a39' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='377' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#b26a39'/><text x='387' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#b26a39' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>04 · OPTIMIZE</text><text x='387' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>约束寻优</text><text x='387' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>扭矩 / 立压上限</text><text x='387' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>ECD 在窗口内</text><path d='M490 55 h8' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M498 55 l-3.6 -3.4 v6.8 z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='500' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#767a2e' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='500' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#767a2e'/><text x='510' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#767a2e' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>05 · HUMAN</text><text x='510' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>司钻确认</text><text x='510' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>一键采纳</text><text x='510' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>异常可回退</text><text x='310' y='114' font-size='8.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>算法只输出"建议"，不直接下指令——这是钻井场景能落地的前提</text></svg><p>第 4 步是分水岭：<b>没有约束的优化不是优化，是事故</b>。超界的解在优化器里直接丢弃，而不是交给司钻去判断。</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "en": "DATA",
          "title": "你需要准备什么",
          "html": "<p style='margin-bottom:14px'>钻井数据不难拿，难的是对齐：扭矩是 1 秒一个点，分层是几米一个界面，班报是 12 小时一条。下面这张图就是"多源融合"要面对的现实。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 158' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='各类数据的采样频次'><rect width='620' height='158' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>SAMPLING · 多源数据的时间尺度</text><line x1='106' y1='22' x2='106' y2='134' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><text x='106' y='148' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1s</text><line x1='222' y1='22' x2='222' y2='134' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><text x='222' y='148' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1m</text><line x1='339' y1='22' x2='339' y2='134' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><text x='339' y='148' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1h</text><line x1='429' y1='22' x2='429' y2='134' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><text x='429' y='148' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1d</text><line x1='526' y1='22' x2='526' y2='134' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><text x='526' y='148' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>30d</text><text x='98' y='38' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>立管压力</text><line x1='106' y1='34' x2='152' y2='34' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-width='3.2' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='106' cy='34' r='2.4' fill='#2f7d6b'/><text x='534' y='38' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1—5 s</text><text x='98' y='62' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>扭矩 / 转速</text><line x1='106' y1='58' x2='171' y2='58' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-width='3.2' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='106' cy='58' r='2.4' fill='#2f7d6b'/><text x='534' y='62' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1—10 s</text><text x='98' y='86' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>钻时</text><line x1='268' y1='82' x2='299' y2='82' stroke='#b26a39' stroke-width='3.2' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='268' cy='82' r='2.4' fill='#b26a39'/><text x='534' y='86' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>5—15 min</text><text x='98' y='110' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>地质分层</text><line x1='319' y1='106' x2='359' y2='106' stroke='#41699b' stroke-width='3.2' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='319' cy='106' r='2.4' fill='#41699b'/><text x='534' y='110' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>按层段</text><text x='98' y='134' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>班报与事件</text><line x1='410' y1='130' x2='410' y2='130' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='3.2' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='410' cy='130' r='2.4' fill='#9ba3a9'/><text x='534' y='134' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>12 h</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　频次差三个数量级。任何"多源融合"的第一步，都是把这张图上的点对齐到同一条深度轴。</p><p style='margin-top:12px'><b>数据准备清单</b></p><p>· <b>高频钻井参数</b>：1—10 s 采样，单井 10 万—100 万条，无需逐条标注<br>· <b>地质分层与岩性</b>：来自录井与测井，作为分段标签<br>· <b>复杂情况记录</b>：卡钻 / 井漏 / 气侵，事件级标注<br>· <b>钻头与钻具台账</b>：型号、起下钻时间，用于分段与归因</p><p><b>常见误区</b>　把 12 小时的班报插值到秒级。这不叫融合，这叫制造假信号——<b>先重采样再谈模型</b>。</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 4,
          "en": "DIFFICULTY",
          "title": "技术难度与参考方向",
          "html": "<div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:8px'><span class='dtag' data-d='高'>难度 高</span><span style='font-size:12px;color:#79828a'>数据现成、任务清晰；卡点全在闭环安全与跨区迁移。</span></div><svg viewBox='0 0 620 158' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='难度分解'><rect width='620' height='158' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>WHY HARD · 难度来自哪一项</text><text x='102' y='36' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>数据可得性</text><rect x='110' y='27' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#3f8560' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='134' y='27' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#e9e4d8'/><rect x='158' y='27' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#e9e4d8'/><text x='185' y='36' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9'>高频参数现成</text><text x='102' y='61' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>标签成本</text><rect x='110' y='52' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='134' y='52' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='158' y='52' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#e9e4d8'/><text x='185' y='61' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9'>分层与事件靠人工</text><text x='102' y='86' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>闭环风险</text><rect x='110' y='77' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='134' y='77' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='158' y='77' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><text x='185' y='86' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9'>误建议可能导致卡钻</text><text x='102' y='111' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>跨区迁移</text><rect x='110' y='102' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='134' y='102' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='158' y='102' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><text x='185' y='111' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9'>地层一变模型就偏</text><rect x='110' y='128' width='300' height='1' fill='#e9e4d8'/><text x='110' y='146' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a'>四项里两项是 3 格 → 先做"建议 + 人工确认"的半闭环，不要一上来就自动送钻</text><text x='418' y='36' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>难度分级</text><rect x='418' y='44' width='10' height='10' rx='2' fill='#3f8560' fill-opacity='.5'/><text x='433' y='53' font-size='8' fill='#79828a'>低</text><rect x='418' y='60' width='10' height='10' rx='2' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.5'/><text x='433' y='69' font-size='8' fill='#79828a'>中</text><rect x='418' y='76' width='10' height='10' rx='2' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.5'/><text x='433' y='85' font-size='8' fill='#79828a'>高</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　把"难度"拆成四个可讨论的维度，比给一个笼统的"高"更有用：团队可以逐项讨论"我们能补哪一项"。</p><p><b>推进顺序</b>　单井离线复现 → 同区块 A/B → 新井建议模式 → 半自动。每一步都要能用"如果模型错了，最坏会怎样"来验收。</p><p><b>可借鉴的通用技术</b>　时序回归 · 贝叶斯优化 · 代理模型 · 安全约束优化</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 5,
          "en": "WHAT · WHY · HOW",
          "title": "AI 方法拆解：用了什么、为什么、怎么起作用",
          "html": "<p>这个案例的 AI 不是"一个更大的模型"，而是三个部件的组合。<b>把方法拆开看，才知道每一块在替代人的哪一步</b>。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 214' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='WHAT WHY HOW 三联'><rect width='620' height='214' fill='#ffffff'/><rect x='6' y='6' width='198' height='202' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='18' y='24' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>WHAT · 用了什么</text><text x='18' y='42' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>梯度提升 + 约束优化</text><text x='18' y='58' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>三个部件，各管一件事：</text><text x='18' y='72' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>① ROP 预测（给 μ 和 σ）</text><text x='18' y='86' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>② 约束检查（越界丢弃）</text><text x='18' y='100' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>③ 搜索器（可行域取最大）</text><rect x='18' y='112' width='56' height='46' rx='6' fill='#e6f1ec' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='46' y='130' font-size='7.4' fill='#2f7d6b' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>01</text><text x='46' y='145' font-size='8.4' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle'>预测</text><rect x='80' y='112' width='56' height='46' rx='6' fill='#f9e9e5' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='108' y='130' font-size='7.4' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>02</text><text x='108' y='145' font-size='8.4' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle'>过滤</text><rect x='142' y='112' width='56' height='46' rx='6' fill='#f8ecdf' stroke='#b26a39' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='170' y='130' font-size='7.4' fill='#b26a39' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>03</text><text x='170' y='145' font-size='8.4' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle'>搜索</text><text x='18' y='176' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>三个部件可以分别验收</text><text x='18' y='190' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>——这是它比"端到端"好的地方</text><rect x='212' y='6' width='198' height='202' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='224' y='24' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>WHY · 为什么</text><text x='224' y='42' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>人力试错太慢且有风险</text><text x='224' y='58' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>现场每调一次参数要等钻时</text><text x='224' y='72' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>反馈，一天只能试几次。</text><text x='224' y='92' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>人工试钻</text><rect x='232' y='83' width='18' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#9ba3a9' fill-opacity='.9'/><text x='256' y='92' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>4 次/班</text><text x='224' y='116' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>网格搜索</text><rect x='232' y='107' width='130' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#2f7d6b' fill-opacity='.88'/><text x='368' y='116' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>228 格</text><text x='224' y='140' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>可行解</text><rect x='232' y='131' width='60' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b26a39' fill-opacity='.88'/><text x='298' y='140' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>96 格</text><text x='224' y='168' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a'>让机器在约束内穷举，比让</text><text x='224' y='182' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a'>人冒着卡钻的风险去试，</text><text x='224' y='196' font-size='8.2' fill='#242b2e'>安全得多，也快得多。</text><rect x='418' y='6' width='196' height='202' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='430' y='24' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>HOW · 怎么起作用</text><text x='430' y='42' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>约束是闸门，不是打分项</text><text x='430' y='58' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>先算预测，再用三条硬约束</text><text x='430' y='72' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>过滤，最后在剩下的格里</text><text x='430' y='86' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>取最大值。</text><rect x='430' y='98' width='12' height='12' rx='3' fill='#e7f3ea' stroke='#3f8560'/><path d='M433 104 l2.4 3 l3.6 -6' stroke='#3f8560' stroke-width='1.6' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round'/><text x='450' y='108' font-size='8.6' fill='#4d565b'>扭矩余量 ≥ 15%</text><rect x='430' y='118' width='12' height='12' rx='3' fill='#e7f3ea' stroke='#3f8560'/><path d='M433 124 l2.4 3 l3.6 -6' stroke='#3f8560' stroke-width='1.6' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round'/><text x='450' y='128' font-size='8.6' fill='#4d565b'>立压余量 ≥ 10%</text><rect x='430' y='138' width='12' height='12' rx='3' fill='#e7f3ea' stroke='#3f8560'/><path d='M433 144 l2.4 3 l3.6 -6' stroke='#3f8560' stroke-width='1.6' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round'/><text x='450' y='148' font-size='8.6' fill='#4d565b'>ECD 未超破裂压力</text><text x='430' y='174' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a'>超界的解根本进不了排序，</text><text x='430' y='188' font-size='8.2' fill='#242b2e'>所以模型学不会冒险。</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　左边是"做了什么"，中间是"为什么值得做"，右边是"它凭什么有用"。三个问题答不上来，这个 AI 就不该上。</p>"
        }
      ]
    },

    "workflow": {
      "label": "案例流程",
      "title": "案例：一口水平井的钻速优化试点",
      "lead": [
        "目标不是"做一个 ROP 模型"，而是**在同一口井的同一层段，把机械钻速从 16.9 m/h 提到 20 m/h 以上，且不增加复杂情况**。",
        "五步里第 1 步和第 4 步不涉及任何模型，却决定了模型能不能用。"
      ],
      "stats": [
        ["样本井", "5"],
        ["高频采样", "1 s"],
        ["目标 ROP", "+18%"],
        ["约束", "扭矩 / 立压 / ECD"]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "name": "数据对齐与清洗",
          "role": "工程环节",
          "do": "把 5 口井的参数统一到 1 s、深度归位，剔除接单根与起下钻段，按**井**划分训练 / 验证集。",
          "effect": "同一口井只出现在一个集合里，指标不再虚高",
          "trap": "按样本随机划分，会让精度虚高 20% 以上——因为同一口井的相邻样本几乎一样"
        },
        {
          "name": "特征工程",
          "role": "算法核心",
          "do": "不要直接把原始通道喂给模型。先算**机械比能 MSE**（破岩效率）、d-exponent（压实趋势）和滑窗统计量。",
          "effect": "把"参数"变成"效率"，跨钻机可比",
          "trap": "只用原始参数，模型学到的其实是钻机型号"
        },
        {
          "name": "建立 ROP 预测模型",
          "role": "算法核心",
          "do": "用梯度提升或时序网络预测下一米的 ROP，同时输出不确定度 σ。",
          "effect": "知道"哪里不敢保证"",
          "trap": "只给点预测，优化器会专挑模型外推的区域——那正是最危险的地方"
        },
        {
          "name": "约束优化",
          "role": "效果关键",
          "do": "在扭矩余量 ≥15%、立压余量 ≥10%、ECD 不超破裂压力的可行域里，搜使 ROP 最大的参数组合。",
          "effect": "把"更快"限制在"更安全"之内",
          "trap": "先优化后加约束，等于让模型先学会冒险，再指望它忘了"
        },
        {
          "name": "现场试点与回流",
          "role": "闭环",
          "do": "先在 3 口井上用"建议模式"，司钻可采纳可忽略；采纳与忽略都回流成训练样本。",
          "effect": "每口新井都在改进下一口",
          "trap": "没有回流机制，模型三个月后就过期了，而没人会发现"
        }
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "title": "五步要点与验收口径",
        "html": "<p>这张图把五步各自的"关键动作"和"验收信号"放在一起。<b>注意：第 1 步和第 4 步不含任何模型，但它们决定了模型能不能用。</b></p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 196' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='五步要点一览'><rect width='620' height='196' fill='#ffffff'/><rect x='6' y='6' width='118' height='184' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-opacity='.3'/><rect x='6' y='6' width='118' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#9ba3a9'/><text x='16' y='24' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>STEP 01</text><text x='16' y='41' font-size='9.6' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>数据对齐</text><text x='16' y='56' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a'>统一 1 s、深度归位</text><text x='16' y='69' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a'>剔除接单根段</text><text x='16' y='86' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>验收</text><text x='16' y='99' font-size='8.2' fill='#4d565b'>按井分组</text><text x='16' y='112' font-size='8.2' fill='#4d565b'>无深度重叠</text><rect x='16' y='124' width='98' height='26' rx='4' fill='#e7f3ea'/><text x='24' y='141' font-size='8' fill='#3f8560'>不含模型</text><text x='16' y='172' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>最容易被跳过</text><rect x='130' y='6' width='118' height='184' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#41699b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><rect x='130' y='6' width='118' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#41699b'/><text x='140' y='24' font-size='7.4' fill='#41699b' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>STEP 02</text><text x='140' y='41' font-size='9.6' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>特征工程</text><text x='140' y='56' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a'>机械比能 MSE</text><text x='140' y='69' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a'>d-exponent</text><text x='140' y='86' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>验收</text><text x='140' y='99' font-size='8.2' fill='#4d565b'>跨钻机可比</text><text x='140' y='112' font-size='8.2' fill='#4d565b'>与岩性弱相关</text><rect x='140' y='124' width='98' height='26' rx='4' fill='#e7eef9'/><text x='148' y='141' font-size='8' fill='#41699b'>可解释</text><text x='140' y='172' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>"通用货币"</text><rect x='254' y='6' width='118' height='184' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><rect x='254' y='6' width='118' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#2f7d6b'/><text x='264' y='24' font-size='7.4' fill='#2f7d6b' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>STEP 03</text><text x='264' y='41' font-size='9.6' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>ROP 预测</text><text x='264' y='56' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a'>逐米回归</text><text x='264' y='69' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a'>同时输出 σ</text><text x='264' y='86' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>验收</text><text x='264' y='99' font-size='8.2' fill='#4d565b'>MAPE &lt; 15%</text><text x='264' y='112' font-size='8.2' fill='#4d565b'>σ 能区分内插/外推</text><rect x='264' y='124' width='98' height='26' rx='4' fill='#e6f1ec'/><text x='272' y='141' font-size='8' fill='#235f51'>要带不确定度</text><text x='264' y='172' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>σ 大就别优化</text><rect x='378' y='6' width='118' height='184' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#b26a39' stroke-opacity='.3'/><rect x='378' y='6' width='118' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#b26a39'/><text x='388' y='24' font-size='7.4' fill='#b26a39' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>STEP 04</text><text x='388' y='41' font-size='9.6' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>约束寻优</text><text x='388' y='56' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a'>三条硬边界</text><text x='388' y='69' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a'>可行域取最大</text><text x='388' y='86' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>验收</text><text x='388' y='99' font-size='8.2' fill='#4d565b'>无越界解进入排序</text><text x='388' y='112' font-size='8.2' fill='#4d565b'>余量留白可解释</text><rect x='388' y='124' width='98' height='26' rx='4' fill='#f8ecdf'/><text x='396' y='141' font-size='8' fill='#8e5229'>约束是闸门</text><text x='388' y='172' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>不含模型</text><rect x='502' y='6' width='112' height='184' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#767a2e' stroke-opacity='.3'/><rect x='502' y='6' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#767a2e'/><text x='512' y='24' font-size='7.4' fill='#767a2e' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>STEP 05</text><text x='512' y='41' font-size='9.6' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>试点回流</text><text x='512' y='56' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a'>建议模式</text><text x='512' y='69' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a'>采纳/忽略都记录</text><text x='512' y='86' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>验收</text><text x='512' y='99' font-size='8.2' fill='#4d565b'>采纳率 &gt; 50%</text><text x='512' y='112' font-size='8.2' fill='#4d565b'>复杂情况不增加</text><rect x='512' y='124' width='94' height='26' rx='4' fill='#f1f1dd'/><text x='520' y='141' font-size='8' fill='#767a2e'>否则模型过期</text><text x='512' y='172' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>最后的闭环</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　这张图也是验收清单：<b>任何一步的"验收信号"说不出来，这一步就还没做完</b>。特别是第 4 步——"约束是闸门"意味着超界解不该出现在候选列表里，而不是被打了低分。</p><p style='margin-top:14px'><b>怎么算"优化成功"</b></p><table class='dtable'><thead><tr><th>指标</th><th>定义</th><th>本例取值</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>ROP 提升</td><td>试点井 vs 同层段邻井的相对增幅</td><td>+19%</td></tr><tr><td>复杂情况率</td><td>每千米进尺的复杂事件数</td><td>0（未增加）</td></tr><tr><td>建议采纳率</td><td>司钻实际采纳的建议占比</td><td>64%</td></tr><tr><td>预测偏差</td><td>ROP 预测的 MAPE</td><td>11%</td></tr></tbody></table><p style='margin-top:12px'>不能只看平均 ROP，要把<b>复杂情况率</b>和<b>钻头磨损</b>一起看，否则钻速是靠透支钻头换的。口径也要一致：ROP 必须在<b>同一层段、同一钻头类型、同一井眼尺寸</b>下比较。</p>"
      },
      "fails": [
        { "name": "外推区被当成机会", "why": "模型在训练没覆盖的区间给出高 ROP 预测，优化器专挑这种点。解决方向：把 σ 作为优化目标的一部分，或直接限制在训练分布内。" },
        { "name": "钻机差异被学成地层差异", "why": "不同钻机送钻能力不同，模型会把钻机当地层。解决方向：加入钻机固定效应，或按钻机归一化。" },
        { "name": "标签滞后", "why": "ROP 按米统计，深度归位差 0.5 m 就错位。解决方向：用钻时与迟到时间反算深度。" }
      ]
